  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\therefore$ Conjugate axis $=5$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore 2 b=5$\r\n\r\nDistance betwecn foci $=13$\r\n\r\n$2 a e=13$\r\n\r\nThen, $b^{2}=a^{2}\\left(e^{2}-1\\right)$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow a^{2}=36$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore a=6$\r\n\r\n$a e=\\frac{13}{2} \\Rightarrow e=\\frac{13}{12}$",
